{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1RoZSUyMENocmlzdG1hcyUyMENvbnRyYWN0JTIwJTI4MjAxOCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Christmas Contract","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cmDrqhmb6lBytw7HepNfHOMdKiG.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jsQrUWNeJkeoRZeslC07wNI36Tb.jpg","description":"It’s Jolie’s first time going back home to Louisiana since her devastating break-up with Foster Burke. Seeing him is inevitable as their parents run the town’s annual Christmas Market together, but when she discovers Foster is bringing home a new girlfriend, Jolie cannot bear the thought of going home alone and seeing them together. Her best friend Naomi suggests that Jolie bring her flaky brother, Jack, home for Christmas as he has no plans this year. Jolie, a professional web designer, is hesitant; so, Naomi, a lawyer, creates a Christmas contract to give them both something they want—a buffer for those awkward moments around Jolie’s ex and a website to help sell Jack’s upcoming novel. Unbeknownst to them, the Christmas contract proves to be so much more than what they signed up for.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["TV Movie","Romance","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"88 min","cast":["Hilarie Burton Morgan","Robert Buckley","Danneel Ackles","Antwon Tanner","Jordan Ladd","Tyler Hilton","Jason London","Hunter Burke"],"director":["Monika Mitchell"],"released":"2018-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Hilarie Burton Morgan","character":"Jolie Guidry","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9tTERtp2F8uoeRGLDLpbhLuIYE9.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Buckley","character":"Jack Friedman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o4ju4sTWoEMK6QvDjQrqHYRBCrz.jpg"},{"name":"Danneel Ackles","character":"Naomi Friedman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7W3CZ4xMJure0ZiqYLAqPVvkbWK.jpg"},{"name":"Antwon Tanner","character":"Mark","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A4NzQtW7hCmPUCKBvvUlMJzu